<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Amsteel year net up three pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Amsteel year net up three pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	10.6    vs	 10.9</p>
<p>    Net profit		 129.44   vs	125.96</p>
<p>    Turnover		 5,779.48   vs    4,119.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   311.25   vs	280.10</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  114.86   vs  less 95.33</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  loss   50.69   vs  gain 81.79</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	  8.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the company is Amsteel Corp Bhd.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
